<title>ITALY: Fiat MD denies talk of Chrysler deal.</title>
<headline>Fiat MD denies talk of Chrysler deal.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Press reports of a possible accord between Italy's Fiat and U.S. carmaker Chrysler are completely groundless, Fiat group MD Paolo Cantarella said.</p>
<p>Cantarella was asked to comment on the talk by reporters at the Geneva car show on Tuesday, a car sector source in Turin said.</p>
<p>&quot;These are rumours which surface periodically but they have no basis,&quot; Cantarella told reporters.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
